[00:53.22]ka kau ke
[00:55.73]➤ ka se kau – teeno taar
[00:58.24]➤ ken kabhyaam – dohraa dvaar
[01:00.76]➤ kai kahe kai baar
[01:03.27]➤ kaa ke beech mein kaun karaar
[01:05.78]ken kabhyaam kai
[01:08.29]kavim kaviim kavayah
[01:10.80]➤ kavi bhi kya jaane kaa kaa arth
[01:13.32]➤ kavi bhi phire kaal ke harth
[01:15.83]kahaam katham kathaam
[01:18.34]➤ kahaam gayaa kaun kaho
[01:20.85]➤ katham kathaam kahe kaho
[01:23.36]➤ kathaam ki kathaa kya kya
[01:25.88]➤ kaal ke kaan mein kaun kaa kya
[01:28.39]kasmin kyo keshu
[01:30.90]➤ kasmin jag mein kyo phire
[01:33.41]➤ keshu hi kaa kaanta chire
[01:35.93]➤ kyo kahe kaal kaa khel kare
[01:38.44]➤ kaa kaa bandhan kaahe dhare
[01:40.95]ka kaa rahasya niraalaa
[01:43.46]➤ rahasya nahi to raaj hai kaala
[01:45.97]➤ kaal kaa kaam hai khel dikhaana
[01:48.49]➤ ka kaa arth hai kaal bhulaana
[01:51.00]kya kaun kab kaise kahan
[01:53.51]nai bramaand racha daalaa
[01:56.02]e mera naanak we matwaalaa
[01:58.53]➤ naanak bhi ka kaa kahe gaye
[02:01.05]➤ kaa kaa uttar kaal se gaye
[02:03.56]➤ maatvaale ko kaun sambhaale
[02:06.07]➤ kaa kaa chakkar kaal nivaale
[02:08.58]kaa de chakkar k nu dala
[02:11.10]kada kachcha karpaan kanghi kesh
[02:13.61]➤ kadaa na chhute – kaal kaa haath
[02:16.12]➤ kachcha kaahe – kachcha saath
[02:18.63]➤ karpaan uthaave – kaal kaa naath
[02:21.14]➤ kanghi kare – kesh bhi raakhe
[02:23.66]➤ kaal ke aage sab kuchh bhaakhe
[02:26.17]sakkhe purus nu ditte bhesh
[02:28.68]➤ sakkha kaun – jo kaal na jaane
[02:31.19]➤ bhesh badale – kaal pahichaane
[02:33.70]➤ kaal jo pahichaan liya
[02:36.22]➤ ka kaa rahasya aap hi aaya
[02:38.73]chanddalaa de dna nai
[02:41.24]onnu wi dohkaa de daalaa
[02:43.75]➤ dohkaa kaun – jo kaal de daale
[02:46.27]➤ kaal se bachna – ka kaa samhaale
[02:48.78]➤ ka kaa bina kaal kaa raaj
[02:51.29]➤ ka kaa mile to kaal ka kaaj
[02:53.80]ka kau ke
[02:56.31]ken kabhyaam kai
[02:58.83]kavim kaviim kavayah
[03:01.34]kahaam katham kathaam
[03:03.85]kasmin kyo keshu
[03:06.36]ka kaa rahasya niraalaa
[03:08.87]kya kaun kab kaise kahan
[03:11.39]nai brahmaand racha daalaa
[03:13.90]e mera naanak we matwaalaa
[03:16.41]kaa de chakkar k nu dala
[03:18.92]kada kachcha karpaan kanghi kesh
[03:21.44]sakkhe purus nu ditte bhesh
[03:23.95]chanddalaa de dna nai
[03:26.46]onnu wi dohkaa de daalaa
[03:28.97]ka... kaa... kya... kyo...
[03:31.48]kahan kab tak kisko kyon
[03:34.00]khalq khuda kufr karam
[03:36.51]khoon kaleje kaa, kaghaz kalam
[03:39.02]khaali karo kya kahe kabeer
[03:41.53]kankar kaahe karein taqeer
[03:44.04]kuttaa kaalaa kya jaane
[03:46.56]kaaba kaun, kaun but-khaana
[03:49.07]kaafir kahe kaaba chale
[03:51.58]qazi kahe qabar chale
[03:54.09]kaa de chakkar mein kaalaa phire
[03:56.61]kaal kaa kaal kahaan se tire
[03:59.12]kadaa na toota, kes na kaate
[04:01.63]kanghi na rukhi, karpaan na haathe
[04:04.14]kachcha kaahe kaa rakhdaa baandh
[04:06.65]kaal kaa khel, na jaane aadh
[04:09.17]khaak se kaaya, kaaya se kaam
[04:11.68]kaam se krodh, krodh se jaam
[04:14.19]kaun si kaayaa kaahe si kathaa
[04:16.70]kaa kaa rahasya – bas kaal kaa naath
[04:19.21]kahaam gaye sab kavim kaviim
[04:21.73]kavayah kaahe bane nayeem
[04:24.24]kasmin jag mein kyo nahi chain
[04:26.75]keshu hi to hai maaya mail
[04:29.26]ka kau ke – teeno paal
[04:31.78]ken kabhyaam – dohe ka jaal
[04:34.29]kai – kaahe ko kai baar
[04:36.80]kathaam katham – kahta hai koi bichaar
[04:39.31]ka kaa rahasya – kya bataaye
[04:41.82]kya likhe kaghaz kya mitaaye
[04:44.34]jeh kavan kahan kis karan
[04:46.85]so kaal – so khaas – so khanjar – so kiran
